    About 82% of the human v1 probes (probe sequences) were replaced or 
removed in v2. Therefore, you will find very little overlap in probe 
sequence between the two versions. Maybe a sensible way to find the 
correspondence is to match the gene symbols (better to Entrez gene id) 
or RefSeq gene names.

