>        REPORT = TRUE)
>

from your traceback result and from looking at the code of genes.rpt.agi()
the following seems to be happening:

1. The function lookup() (package annotate) is called by the function
genes.rpt.agi(). Its variable PROBE_ID is copied from
ddDUP$genes$ProbeName, i.e. your input data.

2. The function lookup() gives an error because the variable PROBE_ID is
empty.

Hence, in your input data, dd$genes$probename seems to be empty. I guess
this is a vector containing the probenames.

Hope that helps.

Georg


