To beat on this

character(0) is a zero-length character vector, so the type is the
same as "macdonald", which means

what = list(character(0))

is the same as

what = list("macdonald")

Now, 1L is 1 as an integer, so 1L is the same as as.integer(1) and the
same as integer(0)

Kasper

